    "created_at": "2021-04-09T16:14:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-09T16:14:52Z",
    "body": "I can pretty confidently state there's no way this could be changed; it's behaved this way since Netscape 1.0 introduced the base tag and there's tons of sites relying on it, even if people writing new sites sometimes find it surprising.\r\n\r\nThe best way for authors to opt-in to not getting this behavior is to provide an absolute URL, which is unaffected by base.",
