    "created_at": "2021-04-12T14:41:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-12T14:41:32Z",
    "body": "CSS does have this feature and it is somewhat nifty. I always wanted HTML to work the same way, but we cannot change it now. The best we can do is probably introduce something like `<a idref=some-id>` but that would have its own set of issues.\r\n\r\ncc @tabatkins ",
