    "updated_at": "2021-04-13T00:18:22Z",
    "body": "Yeah, the CSS behavior is *somewhat accidental*, but useful: <https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#local-urls>. For HTML, it would indeed need to be handled by some different attribute, most likely.",
