    "created_at": "2021-06-23T16:38:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-06-23T16:38:46Z",
    "body": "What about introducing a new attribute for the `<base>` tag?\r\nFor example `<base fragment=\".\">` which overwrites the base for fragment links.\r\n\r\nThe default behavior also threw me off.",
